# Tests

- Vitest, Node environment, `src/**/*.test.ts` (`vite.config.ts`).
- Import `describe`, `expect`, `it` from `vitest`.
- Schema/metamodel tests belong in `src/schema/schema.test.ts`. Seed must parse + pass `integrityErrors`.
- Prefer `buildSampleWorkspace()` / `buildEmptyWorkspace()` over one-off fixtures.
- When adding a reference rule or component field, add a legal + illegal case (see `isReferenceAllowed` tests).
- Repository tests: in-memory engine, not OPFS. Graph/layout tests stay pure.

```ts
const parsed = bundleSchema.safeParse(bundle);
expect(parsed.success).toBe(true);
expect(integrityErrors(bundle)).toEqual([]);
```

Run `pnpm test` for the files you touched. Do not snapshot entire Northstar JSON.
